{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/15325-mummy-gmc-anybody-done-it","id":15325,"title":"Mummy GMC, anybody done it?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mummy: The Curse"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-21T06:06:54-08:00","id":15325,"title":"Mummy GMC, anybody done it?","content":"So, have anybody done a good complete conversion on Mummy to GMC rules-set?<br /> I do wish Mummy had come with the conversion already as it was almost parallel with it though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1159-kjetilkverndokken","name":"kjetilkverndokken","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1159_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T06:01:26-08:00","id":17667,"title":"","content":"Mummy went into production before GMC went into production. It was clearly stated that it would not use GMC rules when it went into production. The developers have said there are no plans to officially convert it, although nothing is to stop you from converting it yourself. I believe there are already some Mummy-GMC rules conversions on the net (try your google-fu): <a href=\"http://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php?677213-Mummy-The-Curse-Fan-project-Updating-to-GMC-Rules\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php?...g-to-GMC-Rules</a><br /> <br /> Seeing that Werewolf the Forsaken and Mage the Awakening are getting rules updates, it would not be out of the realm of possibility that Mummy could, but I seriously doubt that any of the limited game lines will get the rules update that the core 3 lines are getting. However, if sales show differently, who knows :-)","signature"